sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Mgr as Manager LLM
    participant SA as Strategy Advisor
    participant MA as Market Analyst
    participant SS as Stock Screener
    participant SC as Stock Checker
    participant PB as Portfolio Builder

    User->>Mgr: Capital, risk tolerance, horizon
    Mgr->>SA: Collect & validate strategy
    SA-->>User: Clarifying questions
    User-->>SA: Answers
    SA->>Mgr: Investment strategy

    Mgr->>MA: Find 5 market trends
    MA->>Mgr: 5 trends
    Mgr-->>User: Present trends
    User-->>Mgr: Selected trends

    Mgr->>SS: Screen top stocks per trend
    SS->>Mgr: Stock candidates

    Mgr->>SC: Validate stocks via Finnhub
    SC->>Mgr: Go / No-go per stock

    Mgr->>PB: Build final portfolio
    PB->>Mgr: Portfolio table
    Mgr->>User: Portfolio recommendation
